Pitzer Suites offers modern guest accommodation in Glen Austin, Midrand, conveniently located for business travellers visiting the Midrand and Waterfall business districts. The property offers a selection of Classic, Comfort and Premium Suites, catering to both short-term business visits and extended stays.

Each suite is equipped with complimentary Wi-Fi, a dedicated workstation, a coffee and tea station and a mini-bar fridge. Air-conditioned accommodation provides additional comfort, while selected suites offer balconies overlooking the garden and swimming pool. Breakfast and room service are also available.

Additional facilities include swimming pools, a fitness area and outdoor spaces. Situated with convenient access to major routes, Pitzer Suites is well positioned for guests visiting Gallagher Convention Centre, Mall of Africa and surrounding commercial areas.
